###################
Running Insturction
###################

1. Download datasets using download.py under PointDA/data and PointSegDA/data.

2. Compute curvatures for both datasets using compute_norm_curv.py.

3. Running our CDND method for PointDA dataset:
   
   python trainer_ours.py --dataroot PointDA/data --src_dataset modelnet --trgt_dataset shapenet --seed 1 --largest False --nwd False --lr 1e-3 --model_type pointda

4. Running our CDND method for PointSegDA dataset:

   python trainer_ours_seg.py --dataroot PointSegDA/data/PointSegDAdataset --src_dataset faust --trgt_dataset mit --seed 2 --model_type ver11  --DefRec_weight 0.05 --target_weight 0.2 --nwd_weight 1.0
